  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7215001",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721500101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721500101": {
            "id": "721500101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Komaki",
            "text": "Hello there, youngster. From how you dress, you must be from outside the island, yes?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500104"
            ]
          },
          "721500104": {
            "id": "721500104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Komaki",
            "text": "Ah, then you must be some manner of traveler, then? Well... Would you like to stop here for awhile and divine your way forward?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500105"
            ]
          },
          "721500105": {
            "id": "721500105",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Eh, divining?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7215002",
      "subQuestName": "Go to Watatsumi Island's shrine",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721500201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721500201": {
            "id": "721500201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Komaki",
            "text": "You're back.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500202"
            ]
          },
          "721500202": {
            "id": "721500202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "We've brought what you asked for.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500203"
            ]
          },
          "721500203": {
            "id": "721500203",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Clean water, fresh outta the Offering Pool!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500204"
            ]
          },
          "721500204": {
            "id": "721500204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Komaki",
            "text": "Ah, thank you both so much. Come now, allow me to give this water to the Spiritherbs.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500205"
            ]
          },
          "721500205": {
            "id": "721500205",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Komaki",
            "text": "And yes, where was I... Ah, right. There is another step to make the Spiritherbs more radiant still.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500206"
            ]
          },
          "721500206": {
            "id": "721500206",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Komaki",
            "text": "The stem and leaves of the Spiritherb will only be truly at home, and thus display the vibrant of color of \"wishes,\" when it is in an environment rich with Hydro from the deep sea.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500207"
            ]
          },
          "721500207": {
            "id": "721500207",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Komaki",
            "text": "Simply put... There is a cavern to the north where the Hydro composition of the water is closest to the natural environment of this plant.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500208"
            ]
          },
          "721500208": {
            "id": "721500208",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Komaki",
            "text": "The concentration also differs from place to place within this cavern. Of them, the Hydro concentration you are looking for is something crystal-clear and transparent.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500209"
            ]
          },
          "721500209": {
            "id": "721500209",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Komaki",
            "text": "But things might get difficult if the water grows turbid, or if you are interrupted by other life forms...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500210"
            ]
          },
          "721500210": {
            "id": "721500210",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Komaki",
            "text": "*sigh* At my age, I cannot quite be sure of the meaning of these words.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500211"
            ]
          },
          "721500211": {
            "id": "721500211",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Komaki",
            "text": "Nonetheless, I trust that you will understand it when you see it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500212"
            ]
          },
          "721500212": {
            "id": "721500212",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Komaki",
            "text": "That cavern is tightly bound to the secret of our ancestors. Unfortunately, with the recent war, few young people have gone there to draw water and nourish the Spiritherbs.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500213"
            ]
          },
          "721500213": {
            "id": "721500213",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Komaki",
            "text": "*sigh* Speaking of our young people, I can only hope that they will return safely...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500214"
            ]
          },
          "721500214": {
            "id": "721500214",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Komaki",
            "text": "Ah yes. If you want to go there to draw water, youngster, please be very careful.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500215"
            ]
          },
          "721500215": {
            "id": "721500215",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Don't worry, Granny, we'll be fine!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500218"
            ]
          },
          "721500218": {
            "id": "721500218",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Komaki",
            "text": "Good, good. Thank you both very much."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7215003",
      "subQuestName": "Obtain Water Welling With \"Wishes\"",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721500301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721500301": {
            "id": "721500301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Komaki",
            "text": "Ah, you've returned. Come, come, have a rest.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500302"
            ]
          },
          "721500302": {
            "id": "721500302",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Granny Komaki, we've brought the water you asked for!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500303"
            ]
          },
          "721500303": {
            "id": "721500303",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "This is the \"ideal water\" you spoke of, yes?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500304"
            ]
          },
          "721500304": {
            "id": "721500304",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Komaki",
            "text": "Yes, and this amount will do the job as well. Thank you for the trouble...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500305"
            ]
          },
          "721500305": {
            "id": "721500305",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Komaki",
            "text": "Haha, ah, look at them...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500306"
            ]
          },
          "721500306": {
            "id": "721500306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Komaki",
            "text": "From the Spiritherbs' radiance... The year to come will surely be a peaceful and abundant one.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500307"
            ]
          },
          "721500307": {
            "id": "721500307",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm, how could you tell?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500308"
            ]
          },
          "721500308": {
            "id": "721500308",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Komaki",
            "text": "The color of the Spiritherbs has always been dependent on the moisture it gets, and the nourishment it gains from the wishes of the people.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500309"
            ]
          },
          "721500309": {
            "id": "721500309",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Komaki",
            "text": "This soul-light is the embodiment of those wishes — the better the wishes, the more vibrant the light, and the more hope there is in our future.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500310"
            ]
          },
          "721500310": {
            "id": "721500310",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Komaki",
            "text": "After all, everyone wishes for a better tomorrow, don't they?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500311"
            ]
          },
          "721500311": {
            "id": "721500311",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Komaki",
            "text": "As long everyone wishes to do something to improve on their present lives a little...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500312"
            ]
          },
          "721500312": {
            "id": "721500312",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Komaki",
            "text": "Even something as terrible as a war's aftermath may yet prove to be a small affair in comparison.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500313"
            ]
          },
          "721500313": {
            "id": "721500313",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uh... So does this have anything to do with its... efficacy?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500314"
            ]
          },
          "721500314": {
            "id": "721500314",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Komaki",
            "text": "Of course. This is the wisdom of us old folks, after all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500315"
            ]
          },
          "721500315": {
            "id": "721500315",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Komaki",
            "text": "Wishes drive and encourage people, and the results of their actions verify their wishes in turn.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500316"
            ]
          },
          "721500316": {
            "id": "721500316",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Komaki",
            "text": "As long as we are able to protect our peaceful lives, and as long as we can hold on to hope even during dark days...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500317"
            ]
          },
          "721500317": {
            "id": "721500317",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Komaki",
            "text": "The divinations of the Spiritherb will always be efficacious.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500320"
            ]
          },
          "721500320": {
            "id": "721500320",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Komaki",
            "text": "Hehe. Ah, youngster, you will understand someday.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721500321"
            ]
          },
          "721500321": {
            "id": "721500321",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Komaki",
            "text": "Ah, by the way, the power of the wishes within the water will last a few days more. If you are willing, you can come by again anytime for another divination."
          }
        }
      }
    },
